      <div>
        <span class="ph-eyebrow">Service 01</span>
        <h2 class="ph-sec-title" style="margin-block-start:0.8rem;">Plant Sourcing</h2>
        <p class="ph-copy" style="margin-block-start:1.2rem;">The right material, in the right condition, on schedule.</p>
        <p class="ph-copy" style="margin-block-start:1rem;">We source directly through our own nursery, cultivation base and a trusted grower network at origin — securing specimen-grade material for projects across the UAE and Gulf.</p>
        <ul class="ph-check-list">
          <li>Own nursery &amp; cultivation base</li>
          <li>Trusted grower network at origin</li>
          <li>Right material on schedule</li>
